{"title": "Bludgeoning", "pageid": 21811, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bludgeoning", "categories": ["Damage type pages"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">   <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"52\" height=\"52\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></b> is one of the <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_type\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage type\">damage types</a> in the game.\n</p>\n<ul><li>For all sources of Bludgeoning, see <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Sources_of_Bludgeoning_damage\" title=\"Category:Sources of Bludgeoning damage\">Category:Sources of Bludgeoning damage</a>.</li>\n<li>For creatures weak to Bludgeoning, see <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Vulnerable_to_Bludgeoning\" title=\"Category:Vulnerable to Bludgeoning\">Category:Vulnerable to Bludgeoning</a>.</li>\n<li>For creatures resistant to Bludgeoning, see <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Resistant_to_Bludgeoning\" title=\"Category:Resistant to Bludgeoning\">Category:Resistant to Bludgeoning</a>.</li>\n<li>For creatures immune to Bludgeoning, see <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Immune_to_Bludgeoning\" title=\"Category:Immune to Bludgeoning\">Category:Immune to Bludgeoning</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Bludgeoning_damage\">Sources of Bludgeoning damage</span></h2>\n<p>The following sections list various ways in which a player character, or creatures they summon, can deal Bludgeoning damage.\n</p><p>Special actions, spells, etc. that are exclusively accessible to non-player characters are not listed.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Spells\">Spells</span></h3>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles\" title=\"Evard's Black Tentacles\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp/25px-Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp/38px-Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp/50px-Evard%27s_Black_Tentacles_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Evard's Black Tentacles\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Evard%27s_Black